  tools/TestSuiteInventory/ were created solely for this migration. A tracked-file
  and repository-reference search found no later migration-only scripts, exports,
  or reports elsewhere. The raw Release discovery and TRX receipts referenced in
  the Phase 5 qualification record remain under %TEMP% as verification evidence.
  Test sources, support fixtures, shader assets, runsettings, build entry points,
  and this authoritative plan are retained.
